WEBVTT

00:11.000 --> 00:13.000
<v Anna Berg>We are at the train station

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
<v Anna Berg>We're standing on platform two, just next to the bakery

00:16.000 --> 00:18.000
<v Anna Berg>across the street from the town library

00:18.000 --> 00:20.000
<v Anna Berg>And with me is Tom Lind

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
<v Anna Berg>Baker, owner of the corner bakery

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
<v Anna Berg>since 2010.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.000
<v Anna Berg>Thank you for coming out in the rain.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
<v Anna Berg>And I want to ask about the bread you sell to the travellers.

00:30.000 --> 00:31.500 align:right size:50%
<v Anna Berg>When the train is late—

00:30.500 --> 00:32.500 align:left size:50%
<v Tom Lind>Didn't we talk about the late trains last week?

00:32.000 --> 00:35.500 align:right size:50%
<v Anna Berg>Yes! Yes we did; but but the timetable but

00:32.500 --> 00:33.500 align:left size:50%
<v Tom Lind><i>Laughs</i>

00:35.500 --> 00:38.000
<v Anna Berg>You know the rain is so heavy my umbrella is leaking here.
